WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
I think the mistake that hiring

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.240
managers, leaders, and companies make is

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.920
they try to

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.120
they love new ideas. They're addicted to

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.760
innovation within their business.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.120
When in reality, it's

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.840
more often than not, my job as leader of

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.840
several of these companies, more often

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.800
