00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.120
that and implement it into our business.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:10.680
So

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:13.320
I I love slow, well, quick, but simple

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:15.040
